# Vercel's Python builder prioritizes pyproject.toml/uv.lock over requirements.txt
# when both are present (see vercel/vercel#14041). Our pyproject.toml/uv.lock pull
# in the full local-dev dependency set (fastembed+onnxruntime, scikit-learn, pandas,
# joblib) which blows past the 500MB serverless function bundle limit. Hiding them
# from the Vercel build forces it to fall back to the trimmed requirements.txt
# (§B deploy, docs/dev/deploy.md).
pyproject.toml
uv.lock
